    {
      "id": "eudiplo",
      "name": "EUDIPLO",
      "description": "Open-source middleware that a backend calls to issue and verify EUDI Wallet attestations. It implements OpenID4VCI 1.0 and OpenID4VP 1.0 with DCQL, SD-JWT VC and ISO/IEC 18013-5 mdoc, publishes a Token Status List, and returns the result by webhook, server-sent events or polling. Operators run it themselves as a container, with optional PostgreSQL, S3-compatible storage and an external key store. One instance can serve many tenants. It is an LF Decentralized Trust project, previously hosted by the OpenWallet Foundation.",
      "website": "https://eudiplo.dev/",
