      "id": "mattr-vii",
      "name": "MATTR VII",
      "description": "Cloud platform for issuing and verifying ISO mdocs. MATTR VII issues mdocs with OpenID4VCI 1.0, using the authorization-code and pre-authorized-code flows, and verifies remote mdoc presentations with OpenID4VP as profiled by ISO/IEC 18013-7:2025 Annex B. That profile follows OpenID4VP draft 18 rather than the final 1.0 specification, and remote verification requests mdocs only. Each customer uses an isolated tenant on a regional shared cloud or a dedicated cloud. The platform is reached through REST APIs and OAuth clients, and the verifier web SDK starts the browser session.",
