      "id": "procivis-one",
      "name": "Procivis One Core",
      "description": "Open-source core used to issue and verify credentials on infrastructure you run yourself, in your data center or at a cloud provider. It exposes a REST API and server SDKs, issues with OpenID4VCI 1.0, and verifies with OpenID4VP 1.0 and the ISO/IEC 18013-5 proximity flow. Documented credential formats are SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc. Revocation can use a Token Status List, a Bitstring Status List or a CRL. Licensed under Apache-2.0. Desk, the Business Wallet and the Verifier App are separate enterprise components.",
